      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخِيصٌ</span></b>  A <i>cheap,</i> or <i>low-priced,</i> thing; (Msb;)
a <i>low</i> price. (S, A.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  (tropical:)  A <i>quick</i> death. (Lth,
A, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخْصٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
(tropical:)  <i>Soft, without strength or sturdiness, and without
endurance:</i> or <i>stupid, dull, wanting in intelligence;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلِيدٌ</span>. (TA.)

